.. Funktion       : Start-Button im Infosystem ATUNTERLAGEN
.. Functionality  : Start button in infosystem ATUNTERLAGEN
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..  start with empty table
.make screen line --
..
..  new list of documents
..  only filled if query with ahnum + vstaat
.formula M|kuntliste = ""
..
..  query
.formula M|select = "$,,;ahnum<>`"
.formula M|select = "$,,;id==" + M|kahnum^id  ? _F|empty(M|kahnum)
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
